    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκᾰκέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>behave remissly in</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεκάκησαν τὸ πέμπειν</span> they <i>culpably
			omitted</i> to send, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.19.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ge.</u>
				27.46
			</span></i>: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καλὸν ποιοῦντες μὴ ἐγκακῶμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
					6.9
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				18.1
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1043.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκακέω</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκακοῦμεν: ὑψοῦμεν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
